<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 333 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 333 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 333 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.3 BLN    1.3 BLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    50 MLN!    383 MLN!   =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 1 BANK BILLS     =	   109 MLN    =	    =</p>
<p>! INCLUDES 274 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING OCTOBER 21 AT 5-23/32 PCT</p>
<p>(INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
